# Only sources and the scripts that build platendoos are committed. Never anything built, and never any part of
# rekordbox: the models, the Windows tables/signatures (made from rekordbox.exe), the trailer's media and every
# build product are made by the scripts or fetched with tools/build/fetch_inputs.sh, and shipped in GitHub releases.

# Build output (compile.sh / build.sh / tools/build/*.sh / tools/win/build.sh)
/build/

# Models (tools/models/, or tools/build/fetch_inputs.sh)
/models/*
!/models/README.md

# Windows address tables and signatures, made from rekordbox.exe (tools/win/maketable.py, makesigs.py)
/tools/win/tables/
/tools/win/sigs/

# Trailer media (trailer/render.py and the recordings it cuts)
/trailer/*.mp4
/trailer/shots/
/trailer/assets/
/trailer/clips/

# Anything app- or archive-shaped, wherever it is
*.app/
*.zip
*.dmg
*.exe
*.dll
*.dylib
*.onnx
*.mlmodelc/
*.mlpackage/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Agent worktrees
/.claude/
__pycache__/
